of key-value pairs to merge into the feature’s state. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values should be valid JSON types."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"text":" if the source is attached to a map and the update was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatched.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A feature’s state is a set of user-defined key-value pairs that are assigned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a feature at runtime. The state object is merged with any existing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"key-value pairs in the feature’s state. Feature state can be read in style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expressions through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feature-state"},{"type":"text","text":" expression operator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The target feature must have an identifier in the underlying source data:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either an "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute in the original GeoJSON data, or an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"code":"identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method can only be used while the source is attached to a map.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/docum